description.narrative:
Information, awareness-raising and engagement workshops for the 265 municipalities of Niger for the revision of Niger's NDC 3.0. Niger, with the support of the NDC Partnership, has started updating its Nationally Determined Contribution (NDC), as part ofits commitments to the Paris Climate Agreement. This revision aims to strengthen the alignment of NDC 3.0 with the vision of national authorities as well as with the Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs).
This review process will include:
• Updating dataand information taking into account recent programmatic and policy developments;
• Integration of the waste sector, as well as better consideration of the water, hygiene and sanitation sectors;
• The inclusion of cross-cutting dimensions such as gender,youth, employment and health.
